scnlib
------------------------------------------
Scanf for modern C++

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  libscn-devel-4.0.1-1bl2
  libscn4-4.0.1-1bl2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  fast_float-8.3.3-1bl1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/eliaskosunen/scnlib

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/eliaskosunen/scnlib/archive/refs/tags/v4.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack scnlib-4.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./scnlib-4.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/scnlib-4.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/scnlib-4.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscn4-4.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscn-devel-4.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(scnlib)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/scnlib.README
  /usr/share/doc/scnlib/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/scnlib/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/scnlib/README.md

(libscn4)
  /usr/bin/cygscn-4.dll

(libscn-devel)
  /usr/include/scn/chrono.h
  /usr/include/scn/fwd.h
  /usr/include/scn/istream.h
  /usr/include/scn/ranges.h
  /usr/include/scn/regex.h
  /usr/include/scn/scan.h
  /usr/include/scn/xchar.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/scn/scn-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/scn/scn-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/scn/scn-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/scn/scn-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/libscn.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/scnlib.pc

